      "docs": "Turn the card on in the chat (one line in each file, see the comments in them):\n\n  features/chat/chat-catalog.ts:   WeatherCard: weatherCatalogEntry\n  features/chat/chat-registry.tsx: WeatherCard: ({ props, loading }) => <LiveWeatherCard location={props.location || undefined} units={props.units} streaming={loading} />\n\nForecasts load from /api/weather (installed at app/api/weather/route.ts), backed by Open-Meteo. No API key needed."
